MUSIM TIGA

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.160
MUSIM TIGA

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:49.540
Kepala berarti Retsuko. Ekor...

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.040
Inui.

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.700
Inui.

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:05.910
Retsuko, Inui, Retsuko, Inui,
Retsuko, Inui, Retsuko...

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:08.500
Inui.

