<i>- Kau hanya sampah.</i>
<i>- Kau palsu.</i>

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:31.700
<i>- Wanita hina.</i>
<i>- OTM tamat.</i>

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.370
<i>- Populer?</i>
<i>- Wanita rendah.</i>

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.160
Terima kasih banyak.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.540
Terima kasih banyak.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:40.040
Terima kasih banyak.

