Mana "terima kasih"-mu?

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.450
<i>Apa?</i>

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:57.080
Kau masih bertahan dari uang kami.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:00.160
Mana "terima kasih"-mu?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:01.790
<i>Tidak.</i>

