<i>Dunia semacam ini...</i>

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:23.950
<i>Aku tak sanggup.</i>

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:31.700
<i>Retsuko.</i>

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.120
<i>Retsuko.</i>

