00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.700
Cukup dengan komentar bodoh!

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.580
Apa yang kau tahu tentang dia?

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.950
Retsuko butuh tempat aman
agar tak perlu khawatir.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.910
Bisa kau beri itu?

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:01.620
Tak bisa, bukan?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:04.330
Karena itu...

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:07.500
KONSELING PERNIKAHAN GORI

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.370
Ayo temukan cinta baru untukmu.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.790
