00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:55.290
Mereka berkata, "Terserah kau."

00:14:57.700 --> 00:14:59.580
Ada apa dengannya?

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:01.620
Membuat Retsuko kembali.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:03.830
Tapi mengapa karaoke?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:05.370
Karaoke

